---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro'; import CtaBand from '../../components/CtaBand.astro'; import '../../content/_shared.css';
import { cases } from '../../data/site.js';
const shots = { 'garment-sourcing-erp': '/screens/garment-erp/01-today.webp', 'vehicle-inspection': '/media/vision-single.jpg', 'voice-platform': '/screens/ai-calling-agent/02-live.webp', 'service-centre-vision': '/media/vision-multi.jpg', 'companion-model': '/screens/ai-calling-agent/04-script.webp', 'creator-platform': '/screens/whatsapp-crm/07-mobile.webp' }; const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '');
---
<Base title="Work — seven builds, enterprise and consumer | SparkFuse" description="Enterprise systems and consumer products, built for clients and run as our own. Every case: the old process, the new one, and what the AI actually does." section="work">
  <div class="hero"><div class="eb">Work</div><h1 class="h1">Seven builds. <span class="g">Enterprise, consumer, and everything we run ourselves.</span></h1><p class="p" style="font-size: 16px;">Every case below: the old process, the new one, and what the AI actually does. Client engagements are anonymised; our own products are named as ours. Every screen is a mockup with fictional data.</p></div>
  <div class="sec"><div class="grid3">{cases.map((c, i) => <a class={`card${c.live ? '' : ' q'}`} href={`${base}/work/${c.slug}/`}><div class="thumb shot"><img src={`${base}${shots[c.slug]}`} alt="" loading="lazy" style="width: 100%; height: auto; aspect-ratio: 16 / 10; object-fit: cover; object-position: top; display: block;" /></div><div class="mono">{c.tag}</div><div class="t">{c.name}</div><div style="display: flex; gap: 18px; flex-wrap: wrap;">{c.nums.map(([n, l]) => <div><div class="num" style="font-size: 22px;">{n}</div><div class="mono" style="font-size: 9.5px;">{l}</div></div>)}</div></a>)}</div></div>
  <div class="sec"><div class="grid4">
    <div class="card q"><div class="eb">01</div><div class="t">The process gets rewritten first</div><div class="d">In every case the win came from changing how the work flows — the software just made the new flow possible.</div></div>
    <div class="card q"><div class="eb">02</div><div class="t">AI orchestrates, it isn't a feature</div><div class="d">The AI plans, assigns, reads, scores and flags. It sits at the centre of the workflow, not in a chat box in the corner.</div></div>
    <div class="card q"><div class="eb">03</div><div class="t">Built to be operated</div><div class="d">Every system has an owner's view: what's live, what's stuck, what it costs. Systems that can't be watched don't survive contact with a real business.</div></div>
    <div class="card q"><div class="eb">04</div><div class="t">One person answerable</div><div class="d">Strategy, build and rollout on all seven ran through the founder. No coordination tax, no vendor gaps for the client to manage.</div></div>
  </div></div>
  <div class="container" style="padding-top: clamp(48px, 6vw, 80px);"><CtaBand h="Your process is the eighth case study." /></div>
</Base>
